# This repository is the public page for Radio Okay: the README and its images, plus the
# requested-stations list (stations/extra-stations.json) that the app downloads. Nothing else.
# The app's source, the signing key and the APKs stay on this PC and are never pushed.
# APKs go up as GitHub *Releases* (see release/HOW-TO-UPDATE.md), not into the repo.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/stations/
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/readme/
